  <div class="nc-static-body">
    <section>
      <h2>Terms of use</h2>
      <p>NoCrumbs is provided as-is for personal, non-commercial use. By using the platform you agree not to post illegal content, harass other users, or attempt to compromise the security of the service. We reserve the right to remove content or suspend accounts that violate these terms.</p>
      <p>NoCrumbs is a student project and is offered without any warranty of uptime, data retention, or continued availability.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you create an account or use NoCrumbs, we collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Account credentials:</strong> your email address and a securely hashed password.</li>
        <li><strong>Profile information:</strong> your display name and any profile details you choose to add.</li>
        <li><strong>Content you create:</strong> meal posts, photos, comments, RSVPs, and likes.</li>
        <li><strong>Social connections:</strong> friend relationships and community memberships you establish.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>We use your data solely to operate the NoCrumbs platform — to authenticate you, display your content to other users, and power social features. We do not sell your data, share it with advertisers, or use it for any purpose beyond running the service.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Data deletion</h2>
      <p>You can delete individual posts and comments directly from the platform at any time. To request full account and data deletion, email <strong>caleb.weldon04@gmail.com</strong> with the subject line "Data Deletion Request." We will process your request within 30 days.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms or our privacy practices: <strong>caleb.weldon04@gmail.com</strong></p>
    </section>
